@startuml safety_partitioning
!theme plain
title Safety Partitioning — ASIL-B Boundary

rectangle "QM Partition (Application)" as QM {
    component "NvM" as NvM
    component "SWC" as SWC
    component "MemIf" as MemIf
}

rectangle "ASIL-B Partition (BSW)" as ASILB #LightGreen {
    component "Fee" as Fee {
        component "Fee.c" as FeeC
        component "Fee_StateMachine.c" as FeeSM
        component "Fee_Sector.c" as FeeSec
        component "Fee_GarbageCollect.c" as FeeGC
        component "Fee_Crc.c" as FeeCrc
        component "Fee_Safety.c" as FeeSafety
    }
    component "MemAcc" as MemAcc {
        component "MemAcc.c" as MAC
        component "MemAcc_JobProcessing.c" as MAJob
        component "MemAcc_AddressArea.c" as MAAddr
    }
    component "Det" as Det
    component "Dem" as Dem
    component "SchM" as SchM
}

rectangle "ASIL-B MCAL Partition" as MCAL #LightCyan {
    component "Mem_DFLS" as MemDFLS
}

rectangle "Hardware" as HW #LightGray {
    component "TC3xx DFLASH" as DFLASH
    component "TC3xx ECC Unit" as ECC
    component "TC3xx DMU" as DMU
}

SWC --> NvM
NvM --> MemIf
MemIf --> FeeC
FeeC --> FeeSM
FeeSM --> FeeSec
FeeSM --> FeeGC
FeeSM --> FeeCrc
FeeC --> FeeSafety
FeeSM --> MAC
MAC --> MAJob
MAC --> MAAddr
MAJob --> MemDFLS
MemDFLS --> DMU
DMU --> DFLASH
DFLASH --> ECC

FeeC --> Det
FeeC --> SchM
FeeSafety --> Det
FeeSafety --> Dem
FeeSM --> Dem
MAC --> Det
MAC --> SchM
MAJob --> Dem

note bottom of ASILB
    **Safety Mechanisms in ASIL-B Partition:**
    1. CRC-16 CCITT data integrity (Fee_Crc.c)
    2. RAM CRC cyclic check (Fee_Safety.c)
    3. Flow counter monitoring (Fee_Safety.c)
    4. Two-phase commit protocol (Fee_StateMachine.c)
    5. Read-back verification (Fee_StateMachine.c)
    6. DET parameter validation (Fee.c, MemAcc.c)
    7. DEM production error reporting
    8. Address bounds validation (MemAcc_AddressArea.c)
    9. ECC error propagation (MemAcc_JobProcessing.c)
    
    **No dynamic memory allocation.**
    **All buffers statically allocated:**
    - Fee_Sector_HeaderBuffer[32]
    - Fee_Sector_WriteBuffer[FEE_MAX_BLOCK_SIZE]
    - Fee_GcCopyBuffer[FEE_MAX_BLOCK_SIZE]
    - MemAcc_CompareBuffer[32]
end note

note top of QM
    **MPU Configuration Required:**
    <PLACEHOLDER_REQUIRED>
    OS must enforce partition
    boundaries via TC3xx MPU.
end note

@enduml
